Before keeping the wording I re-checked the row against the landed code, and it holds:
- the NOT_READY message names what is not certified (executionProfile.ts:108-125), and no env var or label is consulted;
- creation past BACKLOG goes through the readiness check (taskStore.ts:325-328), and so does PLAN_APPROVED (taskStore.ts:693);
- the settings validator refuses any update while the stored profile is unusable (validators.ts:220-223);
- neither the JetBrains nor the VS Code source references executionProfile;
- WS UPDATE_SETTINGS goes through state.updateSettings.
